[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0005","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0002","title":"Caldera OpenLinux NFS mountd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NFS 服务中的 mountd 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 RPC 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获得 root 权限，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞主要影响 RedHat Linux 5.1、Caldera OpenLinux Standard 1.2 等 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0002"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-10-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 NFS mountd 相关软件包。Red Hat Linux 用户应升级至 5.2 及以上版本；Caldera OpenLinux 用户应升级至 Standard 1.3 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上封锁 NFS 相关端口（如 TCP/UDP 111、2049），或直接禁用 NFS 服务（`/etc/init.d/nfs stop`）及 rpc.mountd 守护进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-006.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/121","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19096"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0003","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0002","title":"Linux NFS mountd 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NFS mountd 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 root 权限。该漏洞主要影响 RedHat Linux 5.1、Caldera OpenLinux Standard 1.2 等早期 Linux 发行版，属于经典远程提权漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0002"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1998-10-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:18Z","remediation":"升级到不受影响的 Linux 内核版本（Red Hat Linux 5.2 及以上、Caldera OpenLinux 2.2 及以上已修复该漏洞）。对于仍运行 Red Hat Linux 5.1 或 Caldera OpenLinux 1.2 等早期版本的系统，应立即迁移到受支持的现代 Linux 发行版。若暂时无法迁移，可在防火墙上限制对 mountd 端口（UDP/TCP 635）的访问，仅允许可信主机连接，或在 NFS 服务配置中禁用不必要的挂载导出，以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-006.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/121","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19096","https: