cess 或 location 指令设置 IP 白名单和 HTTP Basic 认证，限制仅授权管理员访问该 CGI 路径，同时配置防火墙仅允许可信 IP 段访问服务器 80/443 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90786656409618&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1381.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1381","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1381.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1381.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvpp-xm28-64rv/GHSA-fvpp-xm28-64rv.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1381.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87897/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000376.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2d15933a-a189-4787-9dd4-16191d769371.json","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/linux.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1485.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1485.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1250","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1185","title":"SCO mscreen 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 及其他 SCO 操作系统中 mscreen 程序存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 .mscreenrc 配置文件中设置超长 TERM 环境变量条目，触发 mscreen 中的缓冲区溢出，从而劫持程序执行流程，获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer Enterprise System、CMW、Open Desktop、Internet FastStart 等多个产品，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1185"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:54Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止维护的 SCO OpenServer 5.0.x 系列，官方早已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级至受支持的 Linux/Unix 发行版（如 RHEL、Ubuntu LTS）以彻底消除风险；若无法迁移，可移除 mscreen 的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/mscreen`）并限制本地非授信用户登录作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90686250717719&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1379","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1185.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1185","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1185.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1185.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vj3r-fw7h-xqg9/GHSA-vj3r-fw7h-xqg9.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1185.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bd961089-d6e4-4666-8665-7ba0d5099b99.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1250.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1250.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1457","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1457.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1291","title":"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 重置连接漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95 及 Windows NT 4.0 等版本的 TCP/IP 协议栈实现存在 TCP 连接重置漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标连接发送 PSH ACK 等特殊构造的数据包，从响应包中获取目标连接的最新序列号，进而伪造 RST 重置数据包，导致目标 TCP 连接被强制中断。该漏洞可被用于拒绝服务攻击，影响范围广泛，攻击条件较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1291"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:07Z","remediation":"此漏洞源于早期 Windows 95/NT 4.0 的 TCP/IP 协议栈未随机化初始序列号（ISN），攻击者可通过 PSH ACK 包推测序列号并伪造 RST 包断连。建议升级至 Windows 2000/XP 及以上版本，其 TCP/IP 栈实现了 RFC 1948 标准的 ISN 随机化；如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙配置 TCP 重置检测规则过滤异常 RST 包，并启用 IPsec 策略保护通信完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10789","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1383","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1291.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1291","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1291.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1291.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6j2v-9wjh-8j7w/GHSA-6j2v-9wjh-8j7w.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87826/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1291.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000374.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fba75ecd-117c-4691-93b4-4f5720378376.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1457.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1497","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1404","title":"IBM Tivoli OPC Tracker Agent 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM Tivoli OPC Tracker Agent 1.0x/2.0x/3.0x 版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 localtracker 客户端端口（5011）发送特制的畸形数据，导致目标系统资源耗尽。该漏洞源于服务进程在处理异常数据时无法正常关闭连接，造成连接资源持续占用直至耗尽，最终使服务不可用。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响范围包括 OPC Tracker Agent 1.0x、2.0x 及 3.0x 系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1404"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:22Z","remediation":"升级 IBM Tivoli OPC Tracker Agent 至不受影响的版本（厂商已发布补丁），或在防火墙/安全组策略中限制外部主机对端口 5011 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接，以阻止远程未授权攻击者发送畸形数据耗尽连接资源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10771","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/382","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1404.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1404","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1404.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1404.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xpx7-27p8-r55q/GHSA-xpx7-27p8-r55q.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/382/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1404.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000373.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--005a4472-d285-4ced-9934-a12f9fbbff71.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1496","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1403","title":"IBM Tivoli OPC Tracker Agent 多漏洞权限提升漏洞","description":"IBMTivoli OPC Tracker Agent 2.1 版本因以不安全的权限（任意用户可读/可写）创建文件、目录及 IPC 消息队列，导致本地攻击者可修改或删除关键文件与 IPC 资源，从而破坏系统正常运行并可能提升权限。该漏洞影响 IBM/Tivoli OPC Tracker Agent 2.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，需通过限制本地访问权限进行防范。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1403"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-10-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"升级至 IBM Tivoli Monitoring 6.x 或更高版本，新版本对文件、目录和 IPC 消息队列采用严格的默认权限控制（0640/0750）。如无法升级，在 OPC Tracker Agent 启动脚本中添加 umask 027，确保新建文件不为全局可读写；同时定期执行 `chmod -R o-rwx $OPC_HOME` 修正现有目录及 IPC 队列权限，防止本地非授权用户读取或篡改文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10771","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/382","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1403.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1403","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1403.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1403.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5h86-f8rg-c9qv/GHSA-5h86-f8rg-c9qv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/382/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1403.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f494dd44-8f2c-4791-8e4c-a237a4f353c9.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1496.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0562","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0562.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0343","title":"The Palace 客户端远程代码执行漏洞","description":"The Palace 是一款图形化在线聊天软件，其客户端存在远程代码执行漏洞。恶意 Palace 服务器管理员可通过向连接的客户端发送特制的指令数据包，诱使客户端执行任意系统命令或程序。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，受害者仅需连接至受控服务器即可触发。该漏洞影响全部 Palace 客户端版本，可导致客户端被完全控制。目前该软件已停止维护，无官方补丁提供。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0343"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-10-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"The Palace 客户端软件已于 2000 年代初停止维护，官方未发布任何安全补丁。建议立即停用该软件，迁移至 Signal、Matrix 等仍在维护的即时通讯方案。如确需继续使用，务必在隔离沙箱环境中运行客户端，仅连接可信服务器，并以最小权限账户执行，避免连接不受控的 Palace 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0343","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b8581edcbd9fb1606112c43470d0a7cb92a751f8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0343.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0343","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0343.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0fec8c5c64ee33c93da01ddd0b28bf8f9f743a61/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0343.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f4ce19e2c9952be92df5da9390e93383644298b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g4rh-vxc3-fpmr/GHSA-g4rh-vxc3-fpmr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0343.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82274/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0343.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0562.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1214","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1214.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0870","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.01 存在任意文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在文件上传控件中粘贴文件名的方式，利用不可信脚本粘贴功能读取目标系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.01 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，可能导致敏感信息泄露。由于该漏洞利用条件简单，仅需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发，具有较大的实际威胁。Microsoft 已在后续版本中修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0870"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:13Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 5.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。对于仍使用 IE 4.01 的遗留系统，建议禁用 Active Scripting 功能，在 Internet 选项 → 安全 → 自定义级别中将「脚本」设置为禁用，或迁移至现代浏览器（如 Edge/Chrome）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-015","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/42b5b7a8a9b34b1b292b9bfd27242e499ccb6cb9/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0870.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0870","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0870.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0870.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cjf6-94c6-7rc2/GHSA-cjf6-94c6-7rc2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0870.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88084/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000371.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/27329332eaf6d7802a105e6a6dc78246a75b7339/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1214.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1214.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0810","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0810.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0546","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 默认启用访客账户权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 操作系统默认启用 guest（来宾）账户，该账户无需密码即可通过网络登录系统。攻击者可利用该漏洞以 guest 身份远程登录目标系统，访问共享文件、打印机等网络资源，获取系统信息或进行进一步探测。此漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。尽管 guest 账户权限受限，但不当配置可能导致信息泄露或作为攻击跳板。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0546"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:36Z","remediation":"立即禁用 Windows NT/2000 系统中的 Guest 账户：通过「计算机管理」→「本地用户和组」→「用户」，右键单击 Guest 账户选择「属性」，勾选「账户已禁用」。若系统未安装安全策略管理工具，可使用命令行执行 `net user Guest /active:no` 禁用该账户。同时建议在本地安全策略中配置「账户：来宾账户状态」为「已禁用」，并确保来宾账户不属于任何具有敏感权限的用户组。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0546","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0546.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7427eace1f860911aaff217b01d8aca088243b9f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0546.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0546","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/19ba23eb6f8fe22cdd9a46164160f96a7cf3fffd/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0546.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0546.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/51a0e15452743e596ced46bb3f156961c52df5bb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w5j7-6c9r-vm95/GHSA-w5j7-6c9r-vm95.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0546.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87877/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0810.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0760","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0760.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0506","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9111,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10797}}","description":"Windows NT 及 Windows 2000 的域用户或管理员账户存在默认密码为空（null）、空白（blank）或缺失（missing）的安全缺陷。该漏洞源于系统在初始配置时未强制为域账户设置强密码，导致攻击者可在无需任何凭证的情况下直接利用空密码远程或本地登录目标域账户。影响范围涵盖运行 Windows NT 与 Windows 2000 的域控制器及加入域的计算机，危害等级较高（CVSS 7.2）。攻击条件为：目标主机开启了域账户登录且相关账户未配置密码。利用方式简单，攻击者可凭空密码直接进行身份认证，进而获取域用户乃至管理员权限，造成信息泄露、权限提升与进一步横向移动的风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0506"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:32Z","remediation":"为所有 Windows NT/2000 域用户和管理员帐户设置强密码（至少 8 位，含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符）。通过域安全策略启用密码复杂性要求，开启「密码必须满足复杂性要求」和「密码长度最小值」，并禁用「允许使用空白密码的帐户只允许控制台登录」策略。在本地安全策略中将「帐户: 使用空白密码的本地帐户只允许进行控制台登录」设置为已启用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0506","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c271719fd48dcc28619dc324e441b822d7b4bace/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0506.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0506","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0506.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e2d061a60b9c6823d20cc72e51f709fadad54d2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0506.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/907ae4099f60f85a9473cd7e47129d370c445f83/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p477-22hv-c2xc/GHSA-p477-22hv-c2xc.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_login_as_users.nasl","https://github.com/pentestmonkey/yaptest/blob/9ec017c3bba687c66d94693020c7a0b45e265ae2/metasploit-exploit-suggest.pl","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/3455d6adfb8ec0cc7fbb444ace396770ca5ca6c0/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0760.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0759","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0759.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0505","title":"Microsoft Windows NT/2000 域用户及管理员账户弱口令漏洞","description":"Windows NT 及 Windows 2000 系统中，域用户或管理员账户使用了过于简单、可被轻易猜测的口令。攻击者可通过暴力破解或字典攻击方式，远程或本地尝试登录目标系统的域控制器或成员服务器，成功后可获取该账户的访问权限，进而可能提升至域管理员权限，控制整个 Windows 域环境。该漏洞影响所有未实施强口令策略的 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 域环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0505"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:32Z","remediation":"在域安全策略中启用密码必须符合复杂性要求并设置最小长度≥8位；通过组策略配置账户锁定阈值（5次无效登录锁定30分钟）；升级至Windows Server 2003以上版本以增强Kerberos认证；立即排查并重置所有域管理员账户的弱密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0505","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0505.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea7161c86d011c8f810b70db6eb52fc6fcb9878b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0505.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0505","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e2d061a60b9c6823d20cc72e51f709fadad54d2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0505.json","https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/blob/bbd7116272e853f39577ba54522637fe18ed9411/Sample%20Data/Custom/beSECURE_ScanResults_CL.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0505.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_login.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0505.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smb_guest_account.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83215/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0759.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0369","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0369.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0186","title":"Sun Solaris SNMP 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统 SNMP 子代理程序存在默认团体字符串（community string）漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 SNMP 协议访问目标系统，利用该默认字符串执行任意命令获取 root 权限，或修改系统关键参数。此漏洞影响 Solaris 操作系统多个版本，攻击门槛低且危害极高，CVSS 评分 10.0，属于严重级别。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0186"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:47Z","remediation":"立即修改 SNMP 默认 community string，将 snmpd.conf 中默认的 \"public\" 改为自定义复杂字符串；升级 Solaris 至包含补丁 105230-xx (Solaris 2.5/2.5.1) 或 105231-xx (Solaris 2.4) 及更高版本；如无需 SNMP 子代理功能，禁用 snmpdx 守护进程；在防火墙层面限制 UDP 161 端口仅对可信管理站开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.novell.com/cgi-bin/search/searchtid.cgi?/10080762.htm","https://www.broadcom.com/support/fibre-channel-networking/security-advisories/brocade-security-advisory-2017-238/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0369.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1253","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0969","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 RPC 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 RPC 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞（Snork），远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的伪造畸形 RPC 数据包触发错误响应，该响应被发送回伪造源地址，形成循环反射放大攻击，导致目标系统 RPC 服务崩溃或资源耗尽。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0969"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:25Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-014 提供的补丁程序，或升级至 Windows 2000 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在防火墙层面过滤 UDP 135、137、138、445 端口及 TCP 135、139、445 端口，阻止外部未授权 RPC 流量访问。同时限制匿名用户对 RPC 服务的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ193233","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-014","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58316128f65d22a226717ff1f92ebf2058e46bc6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8b7c7b13d1542fc7ddfb9cf48e51f3de3ab5c4ab/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0969","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51bb5d1dd73018638fab64f7b55edb2ba6e6a124/1999/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/554ca72965233bd9402be197b5470aad836fe056/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-09xx/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0969.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0969.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1379","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1379.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1181","title":"Silicon Graphics IRIX 在线客户注册软件本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Silicon Graphics IRIX 6.2 至 6.4 操作系统中的在线客户注册软件（On-Line Customer Registration）存在本地权限提升漏洞。该软件在处理用户操作时权限校验不当，导致拥有本地登录权限的普通用户可利用该缺陷提升至 root 权限，从而完全控制目标系统。攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地账户访问权限，无需身份认证即可触发，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞影响所有运行 IRIX 6.2、6.3 及 6.4 版本的 SGI 工作站与服务器，攻击者成功利用后可读取、篡改任意文件并执行任意管理命令，是导致系统被本地完全接管的高危风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1181"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-09-29T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"SGI 已在安全公告 19980901-01-PX 中发布补丁，建议从 patches.sgi.com 下载并安装对应 IRIX 6.2/6.3/6.4 的官方补丁，或升级至 IRIX 6.5 及以上版本以彻底修复。若暂无法打补丁，可移除或禁用在线客户注册软件相关的 setuid 程序，并限制普通用户对注册组件的访问权限以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://web.archive.org/web/19980929000000/ftp://patches.sgi.com/support/free/security/advisories/19980901-01-PX","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-003.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7441.php","https://cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-1181","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1181"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1379.toml"}]